"<strong>No straggling.</strong> Ask Q2. The peak grows to about {#} times the entrance dose and sits at the end of range, {#} cm.",
"<strong>Proton {#} MeV</strong> and <strong>Proton {#} MeV.</strong> The peak to entrance ratio falls from {#} to {#} and the distal edge widens.",
"<strong>Bone in the way.</strong> Ask Q3. The peak moves {#} cm toward the surface.",
