"<strong>Q1.</strong> Why does the dose rise slowly at first and then peak sharply just before the protons stop?",
"<strong>Q2.</strong> With straggling and nuclear reactions off, why does the peak become so tall and narrow? What sets the height of a real peak?",
"<strong>Q3.</strong> Two centimeters of compact bone stop protons {#} times as fast as water. How far does the peak move, and which way?",
